			"type": "textElement",
			"id": "7ee89382-a8a6-4ab2-bb03-023b7d1cf099",
			"aliasName": "Text_4",
			"text": "Pull the old battery out of the fixture and replace it with the new one.|When inserting the new battery, make sure the polarity is correct.|Finally, replace the cover and tighten the screws."
		},
